    "legend": "The cellular components of pituitary blastomas include large anterior pituitary neuroendocrine cells arranged in lobules or diffuse sheets, cuboidal primitive Rathke pouch epithelium with rosette or gland/follicle formation, and scattered small undifferentiated blastemal cells.",
